capability_contract_ref: Q.UI.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.UI_MODULE@V0122
capability_contract_hash: sha256:2c361c4d0fb7fafb2f3500ef64455c8213cdae0ded2ce6ca3bc513104d46fe4f
runtime_contract_ref: Q.SS.STD.P0.CONTRACT.RUNTIME_CORE@V0134
fixed_skeleton_mutation_forbidden: true
extra_operation_file_forbidden_by_default: true
module_layer_forbidden: true
direct_handler_export_forbidden: true
invariants:
- UI_MODULE consumes one exact Business Capability Contract semantic projection directly and does not consume presentation topology or downstream realization material.
- UI_MODULE preserves exact source Operation Interface request response StableError state permission evidence and Capability Logic lineage and may not execute or re-own source business semantics.
- UI_MODULE derives control and view shape only from exact declared payload schemas and complete x_q_field_semantics; code AI runtime samples database shape or presentation preference may not invent missing business semantics.
- UI_MODULE does not decide application or platform presentation context navigation placement page hierarchy Surface layout Theme Render Host or server semantics.
- The External Provider Surface contains only ui_module_resolution_invoke and downstream extraction Instance Package or P2 may not expand it.
- The same exact source Capability Contract ref/hash External Provider Surface ref/hash and semantic projection produce the same canonical UI Module semantic artifact or fail closed.
- Source Capability Contract and External Provider Surface material are resolve_ui_module request artifact input, are not a declared local Capability dependency, create no receiving dependency slot and do not authorize source Business Operation execution.
- An executable source Business action binding requires exact source Capability Contract ref/hash plus exact External Provider Surface ref/hash, and the bound source Interface must be contained in that exact provider surface.
- Every exact source request-field occurrence carries exactly one valid x_q_field_semantics classification; BUSINESS_REFERENCE and TEMPORAL semantics are projected without suffix, field-name, runtime-value or renderer inference.
- ui_module_artifact.logic_projection completely covers exact source operational_relations state machines transitions permissions actors and rule bindings without reclassification or omission.
persistence_requirements:
  owner_local_persistence_required: false
  database_objects_owned_by_capability: false
  physical_persistence_realization_owner: exact repository owner-local Skeleton/runtime
  retired_database_persistence_meta_contract_is_not_normative_dependency: true
  domain_contract_required: false
  cross_domain_database_ownership_created: false
  persistence_may_not_expand_external_provider_surface: true
  capability_contract_does_not_own_physical_database_objects: true
  fixed_physical_table_names_required_by_capability_contract: false
- Every projected request control preserves exact source variability_class GENERAL or INSTANCE; GENERAL has null instance_variable_ref and INSTANCE preserves one exact source instance_variable_ref without resolving its value.
- POLICY_SELECTION PROVIDER_SELECTION and PORT_BINDING variability remains exact source snapshot material and does not create request controls merely by existing.
- Source Capability successor projection always rebinds exact successor source lineage and source semantic snapshot; full deterministic recomputation is the fail-closed fallback when minimal affected scope cannot be proven.
- Incremental reuse has no independent semantic authority and any incremental result must be canonically identical to full recomputation under the same exact successor inputs.
